msgid "<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Linkshells with less than 2 members will be automatically disbanded if new members are not added within 24 hours (Earth time).<br>(<if ($n3 > 0)>Time is up. Disbanding linkshell shortly.<else>Time Remaining:<if ($n1 > 0)> <num $n1>h</if><if ($n2 == 0)><if ($n1 == 0)> Less than 1m</if><else> <num $n2>m</if></if>)</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
