#. ja: <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507><br>※相手と同じデータセンターにいる間に申請の回答をしてもらえなかった場合、仮フレンド状態のままとなり、1週間が経過すると申請が自動的に取り下げられます。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507><br>※ Wenn du auf deine Freund<shy>schaftsanfrage keine Antwort erhältst, während du dich auf demselben Datenzentrum wie der Empfänger befindest, wird sie nach einer Woche automatisch zurückgezogen.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507><br>* Si la requête d'ami n'est pas acceptée lorsque vous êtes dans le même centre de données, vous serez considérés temporairement amis le temps d'une semaine. Passé ce délai, elle sera au<shy>to<shy>ma<shy>ti<shy>que<shy>ment refusée.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. macro: <ui-color 506> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 506 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 507> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 507 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Addon:12740:0:0"
msgid "<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507><br>※If you do not receive a response to a friend request while in the same data center as the player to whom you sent it, your friend status will remain pending for one week, after which time the request will be rendered void.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507><br>※ Если игрок, которому вы отправили запрос в друзья, находится с вами в одном центре обработки данных, но не отвечает, запрос останется ожидающим. Через неделю он будет автоматически отменён.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507><br>※フレンド登録後も、お互いが別々の地域にいる間はログイン状況が取得できません。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507><br>※ Du kannst den Login-Status deiner Freunde nicht einsehen, während sie sich in einer anderen Region befinden.
#. fr: <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507><br>* Même après ajout dans votre liste d'amis, vous ne pourrez pas voir les activités des personnages jouant dans d'autres régions que celle où vous vous trouvez.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. macro: <ui-color 506> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 506 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 507> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 507 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Addon:12741:0:0"
msgid "<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507><br>※You are unable to view the login details of players on your friend list while they are in a different region.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507><br>※ Вы не сможете видеть, в сети ли игрок из списка друзей, пока он находится в другом регионе.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: あなたとは異なる地域のデータセンターにホームワールドがある<string $s1>にフレンド申請を出そうとしています。よろしいですか？
